---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
import RelatedTools from "../../components/RelatedTools.astro";
import RatesAsOf from "../../components/RatesAsOf.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="육아휴직 급여 & 6+6 부모육아휴직제 계산기 — 2026년 상한액·월별 수령액"
  description="통상임금과 사용 개월 수를 넣으면 2025년 개편 기준 일반 육아휴직 급여(사후지급금 없이 매월 전액)와 6+6 부모육아휴직제(첫 6개월 부모 합산 최대 4,000만 원) 월별 수령액을 계산해요."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 sm:py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary text-xs font-semibold mb-3">
        2025년 개편 육아휴직 급여·6+6 부모육아휴직제 반영
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-foreground tracking-tight mb-2">
        육아휴직 급여 & 6+6 부모육아휴직 계산기
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground max-w-xl mx-auto">
        통상임금을 기준으로 일반 육아휴직 급여와 6+6 특례(6개월 차 월 최대 450만 원)의 월별 지급액을 비교해 드려요.
      </p>
      <RatesAsOf note="2025년 1월 1일 이후 육아휴직분부터 사후지급금(25%) 없이 매월 전액 지급돼요. 하한은 월 70만 원이에요." sources="고용보험법 시행령 제95조·제95조의3, 고용노동부 2025 육아휴직 급여 개편 안내" />
    </div>

    <!-- Mode Selector Tabs -->
    <div class="flex p-1 bg-muted rounded-xl mb-6 max-w-md mx-auto">
      <button
        id="mode-tab-standard"
        type="button"
        class="flex-1 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold rounded-lg transition-all bg-card text-foreground shadow-sm"
      >
        일반 육아휴직 (1인)
      </button>
      <button
        id="mode-tab-bonus"
        type="button"
        class="flex-1 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-lg transition-all text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground"
      >
        6+6 부모육아휴직제 (부모 동시/순차)
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
      <!-- Input Panel -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-5">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-foreground mb-1.5">
            본인 세전 통상임금 (월급 기준)
          </label>
          <div class="relative">
            <input
              id="base-wage"
              type="number"
              value="3500000"
              step="100000"
              class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-background text-sm text-foreground font-mono focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20"
            />
            <span class="absolute right-3.5 top-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground font-medium">원</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-1.5 mt-2">
            <button type="button" class="wage-chip px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/30 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted" data-val="2500000">250만</button>
            <button type="button" class="wage-chip px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/30 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted" data-val="3000000">300만</button>
            <button type="button" class="wage-chip px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/30 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted" data-val="3500000">350만</button>
            <button type="button" class="wage-chip px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/30 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted" data-val="4500000">450만</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-foreground mb-1.5">
            육아휴직 사용 기간
          </label>
          <select
            id="leave-months"
            class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-background text-sm text-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20"
          >
            <option value="3">3개월</option>
            <option value="6">6개월</option>
            <option value="9">9개월</option>
            <option value="12" selected>12개월 (최대 1년)</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div id="bonus-info-card" class="hidden rounded-xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground space-y-1.5">
          <span class="font-bold text-primary block text-sm">💡 6+6 부모육아휴직제 혜택이란?</span>
          <p>자녀 생후 18개월 안에 부모가 함께 또는 차례로 쓰면 첫 6개월 동안 통상임금의 100%를 받아요.</p>
          <p>상한액은 1·2개월 차 250만 원, 3개월 차부터 매월 50만 원씩 올라 <strong>6개월 차에는 최대 450만 원</strong>이에요.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Result Panel -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border pb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground">총 예상 육아휴직 수령액</span>
            <span id="res-badge" class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary">
              일반 육아휴직
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center py-2">
            <span id="res-total-sum" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-primary font-mono tracking-tight">
              23,100,000
            </span>
            <span class="text-base font-bold text-foreground ml-1">원</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1">
              휴직 기간 중 매월 받는 금액의 합계예요
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-border pt-4 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-muted-foreground">
              <span>휴직 기간 중 매월 지급액 합계 (100%):</span>
              <span id="res-monthly-sum" class="font-bold text-foreground font-mono">23,100,000원</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-muted-foreground">
              <span>복직 후 사후지급금:</span>
              <span id="res-deferred-sum" class="font-bold text-primary font-mono text-sm">없음 (2025년 폐지)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-muted-foreground">
              <span>월평균 실수령액:</span>
              <span id="res-avg-monthly" class="font-bold text-foreground font-mono">1,925,000원</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 6+6 Schedule Breakdown Table -->
        <div id="schedule-card" class="bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm space-y-3">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-foreground text-xs">월별 지급 한도액 타임라인</h4>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-6 gap-1 text-center text-xs">
            <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-muted/30">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground block text-[10px]">1개월</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-foreground block">250만</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-muted/30">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground block text-[10px]">2개월</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-foreground block">250만</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-muted/30">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground block text-[10px]">3개월</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-foreground block">300만</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-muted/30">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground block text-[10px]">4개월</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-foreground block">350만</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-muted/30">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground block text-[10px]">5개월</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-foreground block">400만</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20">
              <span class="text-primary block text-[10px] font-bold">6개월</span>
              <span class="font-black text-primary block">450만</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Educational Guide Section -->
    <section class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">2025년 개편 육아휴직 급여 제도 해설</h2>
      
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-muted/20 p-4">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground mb-1.5">사후지급금(25%)은 폐지됐어요</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            예전에는 매월 급여의 25%를 남겨 뒀다가 복직 후 6개월을 일하면 한꺼번에 줬어요. 2025년 1월 1일 이후 육아휴직분부터는 이 유보 없이 매월 전액을 받고, 1~3개월 차 월 250만 원·4~6개월 차 월 200만 원·7개월 차부터 통상임금 80%(월 160만 원)까지 받아요.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-muted/20 p-4">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground mb-1.5">신청 기한과 고용보험 요건</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            육아휴직을 시작한 날 이후 1개월부터 끝난 날 이후 12개월 안에 관할 고용센터나 고용24에서 신청해야 해요. 고용보험 피보험단위기간이 합산 180일 이상이어야 해요.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-8">
      <RelatedTools currentId="parental-leave-calculator" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // 2026-10-17 (FAANG audit S-3): 2025년 개편 반영. 사후지급금 25% 유보 폐지, 6+6 1개월 차 상한 250만 원.
    // 금액표는 SSOT(src/lib/kr-rates-2026.mjs)에서만 가져와요.
    import { parentalLeaveSchedule2026 } from "../../lib/kr-rates-2026.mjs";

    let isBonusMode = false;
    const tabStandard = document.getElementById("mode-tab-standard")!;
    const tabBonus = document.getElementById("mode-tab-bonus")!;
    const baseWageInput = document.getElementById("base-wage") as HTMLInputElement;
    const leaveMonthsSelect = document.getElementById("leave-months") as HTMLSelectElement;
    const bonusInfoCard = document.getElementById("bonus-info-card")!;
    const resBadge = document.getElementById("res-badge")!;

    const resTotalSum = document.getElementById("res-total-sum")!;
    const resMonthlySum = document.getElementById("res-monthly-sum")!;
    const resAvgMonthly = document.getElementById("res-avg-monthly")!;

    const ACTIVE = "flex-1 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold rounded-lg transition-all bg-card text-foreground shadow-sm";
    const IDLE = "flex-1 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-lg transition-all text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground";

    function calculate() {
      const r = parentalLeaveSchedule2026({
        monthlyWage: parseFloat(baseWageInput.value) || 0,
        leaveMonths: parseInt(leaveMonthsSelect.value, 10) || 12,
        isParental6Plus6: isBonusMode,
      });

      resBadge.textContent = isBonusMode ? "6+6 부모 특례 적용" : "일반 육아휴직";
      bonusInfoCard.classList.toggle("hidden", !isBonusMode);

      resTotalSum.textContent = r.totalBenefit.toLocaleString();
      resMonthlySum.textContent = r.totalBenefit.toLocaleString() + "원";
      resAvgMonthly.textContent = r.monthlyAverage.toLocaleString() + "원";
    }

    tabStandard.addEventListener("click", () => {
      isBonusMode = false;
      tabStandard.className = ACTIVE;
      tabBonus.className = IDLE;
      calculate();
    });

    tabBonus.addEventListener("click", () => {
      isBonusMode = true;
      tabBonus.className = ACTIVE;
      tabStandard.className = IDLE;
      calculate();
    });

    baseWageInput.addEventListener("input", calculate);
    leaveMonthsSelect.addEventListener("change", calculate);

    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>(".wage-chip").forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
        baseWageInput.value = btn.dataset.val ?? "";
        calculate();
      });
    });

    calculate();
  </script>
</Layout>
